      "reason": "“Could never have come cheaply” preserves the cost of wielding that force."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H028",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "“Even standing was a struggle” preserves the difficulty without adding that he lacked the strength entirely."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H029",
      "decision": "SOL",
      "reason": "“Pain around his heart” preserves the location and the sentence’s meaning."
    },
    {
      "hunk_id": "H030",
